        "TileImage": "$($repository 5949bb76-bb25-451b-8e9a-97d6b26029ef).Image",
        "Description": "Highway 55 is the place for lovers.\r\rCouples who wander down the road while immediately fall in love, no strings attached. Now some wander in hopes of love, lying in wait across the road. Some have already settled in, upkeeping the residence for their lover.\r\rAnd Marcos Morningstar? He seems to have fallen head over heels for one of the locals across this lonely highway.\r\rThe highway&apos;s fantasies seem to fleet when a non-believer starts to tremble through the road&apos;s cracks.",
